ommandLine contains ".txt.js" or CommandLine contains ".xls.exe" or CommandLine contains ".xls.js" or CommandLine contains ".xlsx.exe" or CommandLine contains ".xlsx.js" or CommandLine contains "⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀.exe")